  "ruleText": "Rev 1602.07 Dial Around Calls. All charges by a retailer for the per-call dial around default compensation amount shall be included in the gross charge.\n\nSource. #8178, eff 9-24-04 (from Rev 1602.07); ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12 (from Rev 1602.08); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
